  "type": "chart-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Butterfly Valves - Sizing and Selection\n\nSelecting and sizing butterfly valves for water applications.\n\n### Resources\n\nA very nice tutorial about sizing butterfly valves, calculating CV etc.\n\n*   [Johnson Controls - Butterfly Valve Sizing Guide](http://cgproducts.johnsoncontrols.com/MET_PDF/347VB2.PDF?x=86)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "flow_rate",
          "label": "Flow Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "GPM",
          "defaultValue": 100
        },
        {
          "id": "pressure_drop",
          "label": "Allowable Pressure Drop",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "PSI",
          "defaultValue": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "valve_size",
          "label": "Valve Size",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 1,
              "label": "1 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 1.5,
              "label": "1.5 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 2,
              "label": "2 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 3,
              "label": "3 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 4,
              "label": "4 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 6,
              "label": "6 inch"
            },
            {
              "value": 8,
              "label": "8 inch"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 2
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "cv_required",
          "label": "CV Required",
          "formula": "inputs.flow_rate / sqrt(inputs.pressure_drop)",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
